{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6322543c34914aec90ec64ba4a45351b891daf2e2ddc16bfb6444fee0638c52d", "ja": "プレステージからの招待状", "zh": "来自Prestige的邀请函", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "eb47159c7843e23ff3abc4c4a1a3e4b92b9c3699025175b4b4532c81b1d24cb9", "ja": "BOT最終戦を間近にひかえた765プロに、\n世界的ハイブランド2社からコラボの打診が\nあった。驚くアイドル達にプロデューサーは\n最終戦は2社に分かれ集客を競うと告げる。\nやる気を見せるアイドル達。", "zh": "BOT最终战临近的765事务所，\n收到了来自2家世界高端品牌的合作意向。\n面对惊讶的偶像们，制作人宣布\n最终战将分为2组竞争客流。\n偶像们干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38f0529bae66a18e4aa159305d917e289eb953929a28efb4d574813042d7a541", "ja": "（ハイブランド2社とのコラボ案件が、確定。\nひとまずメンバーに情報共有できるまでになった！）", "zh": "（与2家高端品牌的合作项目，已经确定了。总算可以把消息共享给成员们了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "b27dab169c7cd5d14e835d0dced01eb94802a9dad08388cdb3b90116bf6706f7", "ja": "スカジと、ミラス・ミラン……！？\n{$P$}さん、本当なのです！？", "zh": "スカジ和ミラス・米兰……！？  \n{$P$}先生，是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f3a2c641acde7e4912f2e3c56c178ff5ae5bfbb2c9e02eb8820ae063b53c87ac", "ja": "ああ。\nやっぱりみんな、名前くらいは知ってるか。", "zh": "啊。  \n果然大家至少都听说过名字啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "5aef5b6ec738b9b3f2eaf309f084aa8b9235618de1d19b7be3e830b4dbf207fb", "ja": "当然なのです！　魔法の国のプリンセスだって\n憧れちゃうくらい、どっちも素敵なブランドなのです。", "zh": "这是当然的了！两个都是连魔法王国的公主\n都会为之憧憬的、非常棒的品牌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "e2333f409081bede72cde927ececb0b2c4c53bd38f34620d036dbefe69232306", "ja": "ボクだって知ってるレベルですよ？\nまあ知ってるだけで、触ったこともないですけどね。", "zh": "我也是知道的程度哦？\n不过也只是知道而已，实际上一次都没接触过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "c96cb556fd3b7036d5eb503de2fcf0b6aab2fb1f0ac0be137b65bcadb9a04868", "ja": "わ、私も、写真くらいでしか見たことなくて……", "zh": "我、我也只在照片里见过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dd0c05a5af7837d35b3a110a056b008b25a7dabd290b932261b793c22f5cf995", "ja": "高校生だったら、それが普通だよね。\nアタシも、ほとんど見たことないけど……。", "zh": "如果是高中生，那很正常吧。我也几乎没见过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "d79ca561901bc21cd89a5bfbae081b43bd4dc4beaa3c9a0e0bfe3b4cdf1beb4a", "ja": "私は成人式のお祝いに、スカジのバッグを買って\nもらいましたけど……自分ではとても手が出ませんね。", "zh": "我在成人礼时收到了一只斯卡吉的包作为庆祝礼物，不过……这种包我自己可实在买不起呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8b41eb589ddaced8106ae5998c860f91728d6dcd1dbe0a8568a07ed82a37d6f8", "ja": "えっ、歌織さんスカジのバッグ持ってるの！？\nさすがだな～、今度拝ませてよ！", "zh": "诶，歌织姐居然有斯卡吉的包！？\n真不愧是你～下次让我也开开眼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "9dc9b28386d292b7aeb5edf8771b6a948d6d1352fde61802d70e92d5d0e3a6d9", "ja": "ええと、それで……そのスカジとミラス・ミラン、\n2社による対決形式にする、と。", "zh": "嗯，然后……就是要做成斯卡吉和米拉斯·米兰、2公司之间的对决形式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "916ef53dae03cbd83405690b108090f10d5b5f69bb8ad065a7801ac09e1f0afb", "ja": "有名ブランド同士がぶつかり合う企画なんて、\nなかなか思い切りましたね～？", "zh": "让两个知名品牌正面交锋的企划，还真是挺大胆的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "c401b0fcfa5dba0f325e4dc92da61e5273a7e5d880d4380b52a40aac4d98b21d", "ja": "本当！　ブランド同士の対決なんて、\nあまり聞き覚えがないもの。", "zh": "真的！让品牌之间对决这种企划，确实不太常见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "49bb6ca01ad30d407d0185c87a4f36531a3911895ef864cfce3875cd9aac3b49", "ja": "ダメもとで提案してみたところ、\n何故か通ってしまって……はは。", "zh": "抱着试试看的想法提议了一下，没想到居然通过了……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "dd03746e9c43944b961a54589234169af515c4bf967ccb13073f36658496f980", "ja": "何故か、って……そんな適当でいいんですか～？\nこれはお説教が必要ですね～？　うふふ……。", "zh": "“为什么”……您这样随随便便真的没问题吗～？\n看来得好好说教一下了呢～？呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4af0c9009cf2b211a40e8685f552388f25da3436c84595573fe43d8cdc483f51", "ja": "うっ……！？　い、いや、\nちゃんと勝算あってのことだから！", "zh": "呃……！？不、不是，我是有充分胜算才这么做的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "783868477240e3104dd8551615795394595878258d36a1ddec26e50e34b3e2e3", "ja": "まあ、BOTの最中に打診してきたんだから、先方も\nちょっとそういうつもりかな……と思ったわけで。", "zh": "毕竟对方是在BOT期间来试探意向的，我就觉得\n对方可能也有点那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d5db88ef42a0248827372841dc3bd25682cf44d101e41e0de7500b38d8069a9c", "ja": "っていっても、すごい話だよね……\n見てよこれ、新作のバッグの値段。", "zh": "话说回来，这还真是不得了啊……\n你看这个，新款包包的价格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "c708ea4a909155227c8016b1d0a36f85267862a5d1adbba73546563ef391d533", "ja": "えっ！？　いち、じゅう……ひゃく、せん……\n……まん、じゅうまん、ひゃ……", "zh": "诶！？一、十……百、千……\n……万、十万、百……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "256c89fbfaf8c650258cc4e39494f5088d7f064accec07d06c3d7a7921030368", "ja": "……きゅぅ～。", "zh": "……呜哇～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "f72e878900ef673d0d6c490942b3394fb4dd74c1841819640b802528cf2a62ca", "ja": "わーっ、可憐！？　刺激が強すぎたみたいだ！", "zh": "哇——，可怜！？刺激好像太强了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f7ca921a8cbb632301167124337eddef2af3a34f6b8ea0e8043748eafdb8503", "ja": "可憐、もう大丈夫？　無理しないでね。\nほら、深呼吸して、深呼吸。", "zh": "可怜，已经没事了吗？不要勉强自己哦。\n来，深呼吸，深呼吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "6e656f07c0a3af28af9c962969aa8773dcea7e3ee13b86ad26768f3151ed483d", "ja": "お水を持ってきたわ。飲んで、可憐ちゃん。", "zh": "我带水来了。喝一点吧，可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "99cc50698a2f00af2cb784aff0979e3d1063cea057357dd66cd6c50d81de0c4c", "ja": "糖分は足りているのです？\nあまあまのマシュマロを、おひとつどうぞ、なのです！", "zh": "糖分够不够呢？\n请来一颗甜甜的棉花糖吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "d60b0334522fcae480d9c7cef3fe74b2a2bf5120d4b4e6a79d87a6071c56100f", "ja": "あうう……あ、ありがとうございます……。\n気が遠くなってしまって……も、もう大丈夫です。", "zh": "啊呜……谢、谢谢您……。\n刚才差点昏过去……已、已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4b01ba644106d1cf5c8c91b56b26baea09cfa5d34da5c70d250134d2d355c3d1", "ja": "よかった……じゃあ、軽く企画の説明をしておくよ。\nみんなには2社に分かれて、集客を競ってもらう。", "zh": "太好了……那么，我先大致说明一下这次的企划。\n大家要分成2家公司，竞争各自的揽客数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b7be86e2baa2aceb110979a47a723c64988728840ee4b5c4650e2c3053c3d944", "ja": "コラボ期間中、首都圏全域のデジタルサイネージを\nジャックして、ポスターや動画を掲載する予定だ。", "zh": "联动期间，计划覆盖首都圈全域的数字标牌，投放海报和视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "71c22052a5ab0e429e1d1c0a23e59ea1c850db3c78d0a6a36cb11f7f6ec94ecd", "ja": "はいほー！　首都圏全域に\n姫たちの広告が載るのです？　すごいのです！", "zh": "嗨吼！整个首都圈都会登上公主们的广告吗？好厉害哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "942cdfc4f174258a1254c0fa8c7377f6f5962ec1ede84facc92b6d5951238f93", "ja": "すっごく盛り上がりそうですね！\nファンのみんなも、喜んでくれるんじゃないかな♪", "zh": "感觉会炒得特别热闹呢！粉丝们也会很开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "015440f348f218fa3a3e862fefd3519f002418668f64450d016ec8a947bdf22e", "ja": "そうだな。プレッシャーもあると思うけど、\nBOTの最後を飾るのに、相応しい勝負だと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我想虽然也会有压力，但这是一场很适合为BOT画上句号的较量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "107275f12896cc35cc36f3afd75d2597fc0e51eff4aa1eb9fbd6735898b86be6", "ja": "そ、そうだよね！　ハイブランドのCMなんて、\nアイドルの花形だもん！　挑戦するしかないよ！", "zh": "对、对啊！高端品牌的广告可是偶像的招牌工作！当然要挑战了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "9c9a14be327963fff390d68835cebf52de1cb9c4384d5e1bd6e4c4a2b0162814", "ja": "う、うぅ……わ、私も、頑張りたいです……！\nもう気絶しないように、心を強く持って……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……我、我也想努力试试……！\n为了不再晕过去，我会坚强起来的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4220d397dc6915667957f2523388326c1ca60b6b22c2e6bbbec60d543e742b0a", "ja": "うん、きっとみんなのためにもなるはずだ。\nド派手に盛り上げよう！", "zh": "嗯，这肯定也能帮到大家。\n轰轰烈烈地把它炒热起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_01_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "3a415a57084960ac9812715651ab9ca7f053c78b9a00e49bfa0282731ae24cff", "ja": "うふふ、言われるまでもないことです～。\n私たちが頑張るのは、当たり前のこと……。", "zh": "呵呵，这种事不用您说也是理所当然的～  \n我们努力，本来就是理所当然的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
